; AnimationTree (active = true) with an AnimationNodeStateMachine root: states idle and walk over an
; AnimationLibrary. The "Start" -> "idle" transition picks the start state while
; `parameters/current_state` is unauthored. Selecting the tree and pressing play drives idle.

